  {
   "example": 1273,
   "level": 11,
   "native_len": 128,
   "text": "\nOne day, a small bird was flying in the sky. The bird saw a big tree, and it wanted to rest. It flew to the tree and sat on a branch.\nA little frog was sitting under the tree. The frog saw the bird and wanted to play. The frog said, \"Hello, bird! I have a joke. Do you want to hear it?\" The bird said, \"Yes, I like jokes!\"\nThe frog told the joke, and the bird laughed so hard that it fell off the branch. The bird screamed, \"Help! I can't fly!\" The frog jumped high and caught the"
  },
  {
   "example": 1022,
   "level": 11,
   "native_len": 128,
   "text": "\nOne day, a little boat named Tim was in a noisy harbor. Many big boats were there too. They all made loud sounds. Tim liked to watch and listen to them. The harbor was a fun place to be.\nTim saw a big boat mix blue and green paint. The big boat mixed the paint to make a new color. Tim liked the new color. It was pretty. Tim wanted to mix paint too. He asked the big boat to help him.\nThe big boat helped Tim mix red and yellow paint. They mixed and mixed until they made a new color. It was orange! Tim was happy with his"
  },
  {
   "example": 1699,
   "level": 11,
   "native_len": 128,
   "text": "\n\nJohn and his mom were in the garage. John was excited to be in the garage, because he could make a lot of noise. His mom grabbed a recorder and pointed it at him. \"John, can you make a loud noise for me?\" John did his best and made the loudest sound he could. His mom recorded it and smiled. \nJohn asked what was going to happen with the recording. His mom said that she wanted to play the recording in the living room for the whole family. John was delighted and giggled.\nThe next night, they gathered in the living room and John's mom let"
